@startuml seq-w3
!include style.iuml
title W3 — Similar reports → duplicates + major incident → P1 escalation chain
autonumber
actor "Students (x3)" as S
participant IncidentService as IS
participant DuplicateDetector as DD
participant "CorrelationMonitor\n@Scheduled" as CM
participant IncidentCorrelator as IC
participant "SlaMonitor\n@Scheduled" as SM
participant "EscalationService\n(Chain of Responsibility)" as ES
participant ScheduledEvents as SE
participant EventBus as EB
actor Administrator
S -> IS : 3 Wi-Fi reports within 30 min
IS -> DD : check(new id)
DD -> EB : DUPLICATE_DETECTED "INC-1062 may duplicate INC-1061 (78%)"
CM -> IC : correlate(open incidents)
IC --> CM : MajorIncident(Campus Wi-Fi, 3 reports)
CM -> SE : publishOnce("1061:MAJOR_INCIDENT:3")
SE -> EB : MAJOR_INCIDENT_DETECTED → admins (in-app + SMS)
Administrator -> IS : classify INC-1061 → P1, assign
SM -> ES : check(snapshots, now)
ES -> ES : TECHNICIAN handler → TEAM_LEAD handler\n(now > response deadline)
ES -> SE : publishOnce("1061:ESCALATION:1")
SE -> EB : INCIDENT_ESCALATED Technician → Team Lead
ES -> ES : SYSTEM_ADMINISTRATOR handler (≥ 1 step late)\nIT_MANAGER handler (≥ 2 steps late)
note right of ES : each level fires once;\nstops as soon as the technician acknowledges
@enduml
